{
 "help": "usage: wgsextract vcf pharmcat [-h] [--download | --no-download] [--vcf-input VCF_INPUT]\n                               [--pharmcat-dir PHARMCAT_DIR] [--absent-to-ref]\n                               [--alignment BAM/CRAM] [--alignment-reference FASTA]\n                               [--outside-call FILE] [--help-all]\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --download, --no-download\n                        Allow missing public reference/model downloads; no sample files or\n                        genotypes are uploaded. Hosts and request data: docs/privacy.md. Default:\n                        config allow_reference_downloads, else off.\n  --vcf-input VCF_INPUT\n                        Optional override for VCF input file.\n  --pharmcat-dir PHARMCAT_DIR\n                        Extracted PharmCAT pipeline release (default: <reference\n                        library>/pharmcat).\n  --absent-to-ref       Treat positions absent from the VCF as reference. Only for a whole-genome\n                        variants-only VCF. Incompatible with --alignment.\n  --alignment BAM/CRAM  Indexed BAM/CRAM of the same sample, for reference evidence at absent\n                        PharmCAT sites. Overrides any companion gVCF.\n  --alignment-reference FASTA\n                        Indexed GRCh38 FASTA used to align --alignment (default: PharmCAT's\n                        FASTA).\n  --outside-call FILE   PharmCAT outside-call file (gene<TAB>diplotype), e.g. from `typing cyp2d6`\n                        or `typing hla`. Repeatable; one call per gene.\n  --help-all            Show this help with the advanced options too, and exit.\n\nglobal options:\n  -i/--input, -o/--outdir, --genome, --ref, -t/--threads, -m/--memory, --json, --quiet, --debug,\n  --config and the other global options are accepted before or after the command; 'wgsextract\n  --help' lists them all.\n\n2 advanced options not shown; 'wgsextract vcf pharmcat --help-all' lists them.\n\nexamples:\n  wgsextract vcf pharmcat --vcf-input sample.vcf.gz\n\noutputs (in the output directory unless noted):\n  <stem>.report.html and <stem>.phenotype.json from PharmCAT. With\n  supplemental reference evidence, also <stem>.reference-evidence.json.\n\nneeds:\n  bcftools, pharmcat, samtools, tabix; depending on options and inputs, also:\n  bgzip, curl; minutes on a 30x genome.\n",
